flowchart LR
    subgraph Client[用户侧]
      Browser[浏览器/ATM模拟终端]
      Views[Vue页面: 菜单/交易/流水/凭条/设备]
      Api[atm.js接口封装]
      Browser --> Views --> Api
    end

    subgraph Server[Spring Boot后端]
      Auth[认证与账户模块]
      Tx[交易模块]
      Device[设备模块]
      Receipt[凭条模块]
      Exception[统一异常处理]
    end

    subgraph Data[数据层]
      Customer[(customer)]
      Account[(account)]
      Record[(transaction_record)]
      Atm[(atm_device)]
    end

    Api --> Auth
    Api --> Tx
    Api --> Device
    Api --> Receipt
    Auth --> Customer
    Auth --> Account
    Tx --> Account
    Tx --> Record
    Tx --> Device
    Device --> Atm
    Receipt --> Record
    Auth --> Exception
    Tx --> Exception
    Device --> Exception
